<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<task id="SRFR-038" project="set-regarding-and-field-mapping-resolver-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>sprk_todo main form fix — make Regarding Record Number + Regarding Record Name cells visible with top-aligned labels (fix SRFR-036 regression)</title>
    <status>completed</status>
    <estimated-effort>45min</estimated-effort>
    <actual-effort>~25min</actual-effort>
    <assigned>AI Agent</assigned>
    <started>2026-07-03</started>
    <completed>2026-07-03</completed>
    <rigor>STANDARD</rigor>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-group>—</parallel-group>
    <tags>form-config,formxml,sprk-todo,dataverse-deploy,wave-3-followon,post-v1.3.2,fix</tags>
    <depends-on>SRFR-036</depends-on>
    <wave>3</wave>
  </metadata>

  <prompt><![CDATA[
Post-SRFR-036 owner feedback follow-on. After hard-refresh of the
`sprk_todo` main form on spaarkedev1, the Regarding Record Number
+ Regarding Record Name row that SRFR-036 configured is NOT rendering:

  - Only the record-number field cell shows (empty) — the record-name
    cell is missing from the visible layout.
  - The fields also render without OOB-standard labels above the field.

Root cause (confirmed via `SELECT formxml FROM systemform WHERE formid
= 'eca59df4-1364-f111-ab0c-7ced8ddc4cc6'`): the SRFR-036 row-2 cell
substitution preserved the original cell shells (including their
`visible="false"` attribute) from the OLD row-2 baseline. The
resulting cells for `sprk_regardingrecordnumber` and
`sprk_regardingrecordname` both carry `visible="false"` in the
current live FormXml — which is why the fields don't render even
though the section is `visible="true"`.

Deliverables:
  1. Patch sprk_todo FormXml to change the two visible-cell attributes
     from `visible="false"` to `visible="true"` on:
       * `sprk_regardingrecordnumber` cell (cell id `{9588438e-3d20-...}`)
       * `sprk_regardingrecordname` cell (cell id `{428bc1c1-b3ee-...}`)
     Preserve every other cell in the section:
       * `sprk_regardingrecordurl` stays `visible="false"` (persistence
         preserved — SRFR-036 relocation is unchanged).
       * All other hidden regarding-* fields (rows 4-7) unchanged.
     Preserve `disabled="true"` on both fields (read-only display —
     RegardingResolver PCF is the writer).
     Preserve `<events>` + `<formLibraries>` block (companion
     webresource OnLoad handler still registered).

  2. Labels — the section already carries `celllabelposition="Top"` +
     `celllabelalignment="Left"` attributes at the section level;
     these inherit to child cells. Neither of the two cells carries
     `showlabel="false"`, and both already have `<labels><label
     description="..." /></labels>` sub-elements. Once `visible="true"`
     is set, labels will render top-aligned above each field by
     default (OOB behavior, matches TRACKING section on the same form).
     NO additional label attribute changes required — the SRFR-036
     substitution had cells configured correctly EXCEPT for the
     inherited `visible="false"`.

  3. Deploy the FormXml patch to spaarkedev1 via direct
     `systemforms(<formid>) PATCH` (mirrors SRFR-036 deploy pattern).
     Then publish sprk_todo entity.

Constraints:
  - ADR-006: form config only, no PCF code changes.
  - Preserve SRFR-036 companion webresource registration.
  - Preserve `sprk_regardingrecordurl` field's hidden state (used for
    resolver writes).
  - Preserve existing sprk_todo form behavior (other sections unchanged).
  - No PCF binding changes (RegardingResolver PCF continues to bind
    on `sprk_regardingrecordtype`).
  - Idempotent: script detects if fix has already been applied.

Step 9.5 quality gates: SKIPPED per STANDARD rigor + user directive
(form config, not code).

Coordination: SRFR-037 is running in parallel bumping RegardingResolver
PCF to v1.3.3 (title font weight + top padding). Different files, no
collision.
  ]]></prompt>

  <role>Dataverse FormXml surgery + systemform PATCH developer
  familiar with MDA main-form section/row/cell layout, cell-level
  visibility inheritance from section attributes (`celllabelposition`,
  `celllabelalignment`), and direct Web API systemform PATCH + PublishXml
  deploy pattern (mirrors SRFR-036 deploy script).</role>

  <goal><![CDATA[
Owner-visible outcome: on the sprk_todo main form (after hard-refresh),
BELOW the RegardingResolver PCF, a single row renders BOTH fields
side-by-side with OOB-standard top-aligned labels:

  Row layout (single row, 3-column visual layout via colspan):
    +-----------------------------+-----------------------------------------+
    | Regarding Record Number     | Regarding Record Name                   |
    | [record-number-here]        | [record-name-here]                      |
    | (colspan=1 = 1/3 width)     | (colspan=2 = 2/3 width)                 |
    +-----------------------------+-----------------------------------------+

Both fields visible, both read-only (grey background), both showing
labels ABOVE the field left-aligned per OOB standard. Companion
webresource `sprk_regardingrecordnumber_hyperlink` continues to
overlay a clickable hyperlink onto the record-number field on form
OnLoad (SRFR-036 registration preserved).
  ]]></goal>

  <inputs>
    <file purpose="prior-log">projects/set-regarding-and-field-mapping-resolver-r1/notes/task-036-sprk-todo-form-config.log</file>
    <file purpose="prior-task">projects/set-regarding-and-field-mapping-resolver-r1/tasks/036-sprk-todo-form-config.poml</file>
    <file purpose="deploy-script-pattern">scripts/Deploy-WebResourceInline.ps1</file>
    <file purpose="prior-deploy-script">c:/tmp/deploy-sprktodo-form-036.ps1</file>
  </inputs>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-006">Form config only, no PCF code changes. Additive fix to SRFR-036 row layout — restore visibility on two cells that were unintentionally left with `visible="false"` (inherited from OLD row shells).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Preserve `<events>` + `<formLibraries>` block. Companion webresource OnLoad handler MUST remain registered.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Preserve `sprk_regardingrecordurl` cell (id `{5150dabe-3d35-...}`) as `visible="false"` — persistence preserved for PCF writes.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Preserve `disabled="true"` on both new-shape fields — read-only display, RegardingResolver PCF is the writer.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Idempotent: script detects if both cells are already `visible="true"`, skips FormXml modification.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">STANDARD rigor: Step 9.5 (code-review + adr-check) skipped per user directive.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>Dataverse FormXml cell visibility inheritance + label positioning</topic>
    <files>
      <file>c:/tmp/sprk_todo_form_pretty.xml</file>
    </files>
    <patterns>
      <pattern name="Cell-level visibility overrides section-level visibility" location="c:/tmp/sprk_todo_form_pretty.xml lines 96-113 (Kanban section reference)">
        A section with `visible="false"` at the SECTION level hides
        the entire section. But when a section is `visible="true"`,
        individual cells may still be `visible="false"` — cells
        require `visible="true"` (or omitted attribute) to render.
        Reference: line 96 (kanban section visible=false, cells
        visible=true) vs line 138 (regarding section visible=true,
        cells visible=false = current bug).
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Label position inheritance from section attributes" location="c:/tmp/sprk_todo_form_pretty.xml line 138 + line 122">
        Cells inherit `celllabelposition` (Top | Left) +
        `celllabelalignment` (Left | Right) from the parent section.
        The REGARDING section already carries `celllabelposition="Top"
        celllabelalignment="Left"` — matches OOB standard. No cell-level
        attributes needed. Reference: TRACKING section (line 122) uses
        same section-level defaults + no cell-level overrides = OOB
        top-aligned labels rendered.
      </pattern>
    </patterns>
  </knowledge>

  <context>
    <background>
      SRFR-036 shipped the row layout + hyperlink companion webresource
      registration on 2026-07-03. Owner hard-refreshed the form the same
      day and reported:

        (1) "Regarding Record Number field is visible below the PCF
             (an empty field cell) but the Regarding Record Name field
             is NOT visible."
        (2) "Fields render without labels above them — OOB standard is
             label-above-field, left-aligned."

      Investigation via direct FormXml fetch (see c:/tmp/sprk_todo_form.xml,
      pretty-printed at c:/tmp/sprk_todo_form_pretty.xml) confirms both
      cells carry `visible="false"` at the cell level. The SRFR-036
      cell-substitution script preserved the OLD cell shell's `visible`
      attribute — a subtle preservation bug from the FormXml surgery
      approach.

      Fix is minimal: change `visible="false"` to `visible="true"` on
      exactly two cell attributes. Labels will inherit the section's
      `celllabelposition="Top"` automatically once cells render.
    </background>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="SRFR-036" status="completed">FormXml row layout + webresource events block deployed. This task patches only the two `visible` attributes.</dependency>
    </dependencies>
    <related-work>
      <item>SRFR-037 (RegardingResolver PCF v1.3.3 polish) is running in parallel — different surface (PCF code vs FormXml). No collision.</item>
    </related-work>
  </context>

  <steps>
    <step order="0" name="Context Check">Confirm context &lt; 60%. Confirm current sprk_todo FormXml has been fetched to c:/tmp/sprk_todo_form.xml (18894 chars post-SRFR-036) and pretty-printed for inspection.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Confirm root cause">Grep pretty-printed FormXml for `visible` attributes in the REGARDING section (id 4bf1f576-...). Verify:
      - sprk_regardingrecordnumber cell (id 9588438e-...) carries `visible="false"` (line 152 area) — SHOULD be visible=true.
      - sprk_regardingrecordname cell (id 428bc1c1-...) carries `visible="false"` (line 158 area) — SHOULD be visible=true.
      - sprk_regardingrecordurl cell (id 5150dabe-...) carries `visible="false"` (line 166 area) — CORRECT, preserve.
      - Section itself carries `celllabelposition="Top" celllabelalignment="Left"` — labels will inherit correctly once cells render.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Author deploy script">Create `c:/tmp/deploy-sprktodo-form-038-labels.ps1`. Mirror SRFR-036 script style (Get-Token, Invoke-Dv helpers, direct systemform PATCH + PublishXml). Idempotent: check if BOTH target cells already have `visible="true"`, skip if so. Otherwise:
      - Replace exact substring `id="{9588438e-3d20-44b9-b8e7-5c2fba328ccb}" locklevel="0" colspan="1" rowspan="1" visible="false"` → same with `visible="true"`.
      - Replace exact substring `id="{428bc1c1-b3ee-4f97-abcf-1dbec6a5b0d3}" locklevel="0" colspan="2" rowspan="1" visible="false"` → same with `visible="true"`.
      - PATCH `systemforms(eca59df4-1364-f111-ab0c-7ced8ddc4cc6)` with the updated formxml.
      - POST `PublishXml` for sprk_todo entity.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Dry-run + deploy">Run script with `-DryRun` first to preview the char-delta. Then run without dry-run to apply + publish.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Verify">
      Re-fetch formxml (rerun c:/tmp/fetch-sprktodo-form.ps1). Grep for:
      - `id="{9588438e-3d20-44b9-b8e7-5c2fba328ccb}" ... visible="true"` — should match (record-number visible).
      - `id="{428bc1c1-b3ee-4f97-abcf-1dbec6a5b0d3}" ... visible="true"` — should match (record-name visible).
      - `id="{5150dabe-3d35-45e8-8f24-24fe96cc6293}" ... visible="false"` — should still match (URL stays hidden).
      - `libraryName="sprk_regardingrecordnumber_hyperlink"` — should still match (events block preserved).
      - Verify formxml char count: expected +8 chars per replaced attribute (5-char change: "false" → "true" but preserving surrounding whitespace) = ~+0 chars net actually (both "false" and "true" are the same replacement scope; delta is only the length difference of the token). Actual delta: len("true")=4, len("false")=5 → -1 char per replacement → -2 chars total. Expect formxml to shrink from 18894 → 18892 chars.
    </step>
    <step order="5" name="Log + TASK-INDEX update">Write session log to `projects/set-regarding-and-field-mapping-resolver-r1/notes/task-038-sprk-todo-form-labels.log`. Add SRFR-038 row to TASK-INDEX.md under Wave 3 as post-SRFR-036 fix.</step>
    <step order="6" name="Update task status">Mark SRFR-038 completed. Reset current-task.md.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>
    <tool name="Read">Load prior SRFR-036 log + deploy script as reference</tool>
    <tool name="Write">Author POML + deploy script + log</tool>
    <tool name="Edit">TASK-INDEX.md, current-task.md, POML status update</tool>
    <tool name="Bash">Execute pwsh deploy script via bash</tool>
    <tool name="Grep">Verify FormXml before + after PATCH</tool>
  </tools>

  <outputs>
    <output type="artifact">c:/tmp/deploy-sprktodo-form-038-labels.ps1 (temporary deploy script)</output>
    <output type="artifact">Modified sprk_todo main form (formid eca59df4-1364-f111-ab0c-7ced8ddc4cc6) with visible=true on both record-number + record-name cells; PublishXml executed</output>
    <output type="notes">projects/set-regarding-and-field-mapping-resolver-r1/notes/task-038-sprk-todo-form-labels.log</output>
