  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Post-deploy FormXml grep confirms `sprk_regardingrecordnumber` cell (id 9588438e-...) carries `visible="true"`.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Post-deploy FormXml grep confirms `sprk_regardingrecordname` cell (id 428bc1c1-...) carries `visible="true"`.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`sprk_regardingrecordurl` cell (id 5150dabe-...) still carries `visible="false"` (persistence preserved).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Both cells still carry `disabled="true"` on their `<control>` sub-element (read-only preserved).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">FormXml still contains `libraryName="sprk_regardingrecordnumber_hyperlink"` in `<events>` block (SRFR-036 registration preserved).</criterion>
