  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes><![CDATA[
Follow-on to SRFR-036 correcting a subtle FormXml cell-attribute
inheritance bug. Root cause: SRFR-036 cell-substitution script
preserved the OLD cell shells (with their `visible="false"` attribute
inherited from the OOB baseline), so the NEW row's cells rendered
inside a visible section but were themselves hidden.

Owner should hard-refresh the sprk_todo form after this deploys and
verify:
  1. Below the RegardingResolver PCF, a single row shows BOTH fields
     side-by-side: "Regarding Record Number" (left, 1/3 width) +
     "Regarding Record Name" (right, 2/3 width).
  2. Each field has an OOB-standard label ABOVE it, left-aligned.
  3. Both fields are visually grey (read-only), non-editable.
  4. Clicking the record-number displays a hyperlink (via SRFR-036
     companion webresource) that opens the target regarding record.
  ]]></notes>
</task>
